---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About · junnhwan"
  description="About junnhwan - CS student at Shenzhen University, full-stack & AI agent developer in the making."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 space-y-8">
    <!-- Profile Card -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl glass-card border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/80 shadow-2xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6">
      <div class="relative w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-white/15 shadow-xl flex-shrink-0 bg-slate-900">
        <img
          src="/avatar.png"
          alt="junnhwan avatar"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left flex-1 min-w-0">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2.5">
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white font-sans">
              hwan
            </h1>
            <span class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-400">@junnhwan</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
              Open to Internships
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyan-400 font-medium mt-1">
            Full-stack & AI Agent developer in the making.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 space-y-1">
          <p>Shenzhen, Guangdong, China</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Social & Contact Links -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2.5">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/junnhwan"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:text-white text-xs font-mono border border-white/10 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path>
              <path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>GitHub</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="mailto:3373484735@qq.com"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:text-white text-xs font-mono border border-white/10 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>3373484735@qq.com</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/blog"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-cyan-400 hover:underline"
          >
            <span>View Posts →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section: Exact README Intro -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl glass-card bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 space-y-5">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Hi there</span>
        <span>👋</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
        <p>
          I'm <strong>Junnhwan</strong>, majoring in Computer Science at Shenzhen University (Class of 2028).
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-200">
          Full-stack & AI Agent developer in the making.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-300">
          Open to full-stack & AI agent internships.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-2 space-y-3">
          <p class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span>🚀</span>
            <span><strong>What I'm into:</strong> Building full-stack apps, and diving into AI agents.</span>
          </p>

          <p class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span>🌱</span>
            <span>
              <strong>Open source:</strong> Contributing to{' '}
              <a href="https://github.com/k8sgpt-ai/k8sgpt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline font-mono">k8sgpt-ai/k8sgpt</a>,{' '}
              <a href="https://github.com/kubevela/kubevela" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline font-mono">kubevela/kubevela</a>, and{' '}
              <a href="https://github.com/k0sproject/k0smotron" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline font-mono">k0sproject/k0smotron</a>.
            </span>
          </p>

          <p class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span>🛠️</span>
            <span><strong>Languages:</strong> Go · Java · Python · TypeScript</span>
          </p>

          <p class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span>📬</span>
            <span>
              <strong>Reach me:</strong>{' '}
              <a href="mailto:3373484735@qq.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">3373484735@qq.com</a>
              {' · '}
              <strong>Blog:</strong>{' '}
              <a href="https://junnhwan.github.io/" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">https://junnhwan.github.io/</a>
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section: Open Source Contributions Detail -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight font-sans">
          Open Source
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/k8sgpt-ai/k8sgpt"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-cyan-300 hover:underline font-mono"
              >
                k8sgpt-ai / k8sgpt
              </a>
              <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Contributor</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Giving Kubernetes Superpowers to everyone
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/kubevela/kubevela"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-cyan-300 hover:underline font-mono"
              >
                kubevela / kubevela
              </a>
              <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Contributor</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              The Modern Application Platform
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/k0sproject/k0smotron"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-cyan-300 hover:underline font-mono"
              >
                k0sproject / k0smotron
              </a>
              <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Contributor</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Kubernetes in Kubernetes
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
